(7668413, 1251462, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...being a biker myself I can appreciate this a lot. I might be wrong but it looks like it was taken in South Africa  somewhere, maybe in the Free State or the Western Cape, but like I said I might be wrong on that count as I know that there are places in the USA and Australia that look a lot like some places here in South Africa. The poplar trees on the right however make me think it''s in the Western Cape in South Africa as well as the newly sprouting Canola on the hill behind the bike. (not voting as I have an entry in this challenge as well)</td>', 'Nice shot...being a biker myself I can appreciate this a lot. I might be wrong but it looks like it was taken in South Africa  somewhere, maybe in the Free State or the Western Cape, but like I said I might be wrong on that count as I know that there are places in the USA and Australia that look a lot like some places here in South Africa. The poplar trees on the right however make me think it''s in the Western Cape in South Africa as well as the newly sprouting Canola on the hill behind the bike. (not voting as I have an entry in this challenge as well)', '2020-07-01 11:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
